Hi Everybody!  In order to allow *Cal Track & Running News* to provide
timely coverage of the Olympic Trials and the Olympics, we've shifted the
2012 issue dates slightly. Look for a full year schedule probably tomorrow.

The next issue is April-May. Deadline for editorial contributions is
February 20th. We welcome contributions from all areas of all four
California/Northern Nevada associations.

Feel free to call me with any questions you have. I'm happy to help in any
way that I can to make contributing easy on you!

